{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_101","type":"agent_message","text":"There is one integration detail I need to verify before further game search: the baseline reports exactly 600 moves even though `players.py` has no level-9 dispatcher. That suggests the tail of the level-8 leg may spill actions into level 9. I’ve been using the harness wrapper’s pristine level-9 handoff as instructed; now I’m checking the documented solve loop to ensure the final implementation will actually start from that same state."}}
